    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Related to garlic, onions, and chives- leeks are sweet with an oniony flavor. A flavor that adds depth to soups, stews, pasta and more! Eat the whole vegetable- the darker parts of the leaves have plenty of flavor and can be cooked longer to tenderize them.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">They are a long variety, tender and mild.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
